        (((E.baseChange (AlgebraicClosure F)).toAffine).FunctionField)ˣ),
      ∀ σ u, ((σ_u σ u : (((E.baseChange (AlgebraicClosure F)).toAffine).FunctionField)ˣ) :
        ((E.baseChange (AlgebraicClosure F)).toAffine).FunctionField) =
